### API playground — install the "REST Client" VS Code extension, then click "Send Request".
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Sign in (cookie is stored automatically by REST Client)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "student@kca.local", "password": "Password123!" }

### Catalog
GET {{base}}/api/resources

### Reserve item 3 (edit the times!)
POST {{base}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resource_id": 3, "start_time": "2026-10-20T08:00:00Z", "end_time": "2026-10-20T10:00:00Z", "purpose": "Practical demo" }

### My reservations
GET {{base}}/api/reservations

### Notifications
GET {{base}}/api/notifications
